      <enclosure url="https://cdn.noblesse.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/19184230/The-Tank-a-Guichets-is-equipped-with-a-new-specially-developed-calibre-from-the-Cartier-Manufac-819x1024.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
